    "created_at": null,
    "description": "Hold a mirror up to the final three weeks of the program of mine you used to prepare for the marathon. That is exactly how you want to train (or not train) for the next several weeks. You might call this a reverse taper. The first three days, do nothing. Then a little running (or ... Continue reading \"Novice\"",
